5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get our fees sorted for next year! Let's make sure we pick a system that's fair and clear for everyone!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here. I believe we should proceed with a gentle approach, ensuring that the atmosphere of our club remains welcoming.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We need to be honest about how things are actually working. No more guessing. Let's look at the real numbers before we decide anything.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Takumi. We need a logical basis for the fee structure to avoid administrative failure. Let's examine the data first.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm in! Let's find a way that keeps the club friendly and easy for new people to join. What should we check first?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I want to know exactly what's coming in! I'll check the ""Bank statements on last year's renewals"" and ""Taster evening forms from non-joiners""!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am curious about the members' feelings. I will look into the ""Quieter members at the winter social"" and ""Weekday turnout since the summer outings.""","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm going for the hard facts. I'll check the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets"" and ""The rota against the attendance record.""","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will focus on the workload. I'll examine the ""Outgoing treasurer's logged hours"" and ""Sign-up records for mid-year joiners.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the ""Last year's ledger of outgoings"" and ""Minute books from the named-grade years"" to see how we did before!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, do you think the treasurer's hours will tell us if the current system is too hard to manage?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I hope we find a way to keep the evenings peaceful. @Kenji, do you think the old minute books have any secrets?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, the bank statements are a good start, but we need to see who is actually showing up to justify the costs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes, the logged hours are essential. We cannot ignore the human cost of bookkeeping when choosing a collection method.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, I hope so! I just want everyone to feel like they belong, no matter how often they come!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
