60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Okay, we have the options! A is a flat fee, B is tiered levels, and C is a base fee plus activity charges. Which one feels right?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C seems the most gentle for those who hesitate, but I worry about the impact on the evening atmosphere if we charge every time.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is the only fair one. It stops the regulars from subsidizing the ghosts and reflects the actual usage of the club.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is the only one that saves the treasurer. Option C would be an administrative suicide mission given the logged hours I saw.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,I really dislike Option B because it reminds me of those named grades that caused so much friction in the past.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, but Option A is exactly what stopped those taster-evening people from joining! They can't handle a whole year at once.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, if we go with C, will people stop treating the weekday meetings as ""theirs"" like they did after the summer outings?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, the treasurer's stress is one thing, but the members' resentment about unfair costs is a bigger threat to the club's survival.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, if we can't collect the money efficiently, the club won't have a budget to begin with. Stability must come first.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, I think Option C might be too visible. Everyone will know exactly who is coming and who isn't.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"What if we do Option C but keep the base fee low? It solves the ""all at once"" problem and feels fairer to the regulars!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I fear Option C will turn our sanctuary into a series of transactions. I'm leaning toward Option A for the sake of peace.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, peace bought with unfairness isn't real peace. I'm voting for Option C to ensure those doing the work are recognized.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I cannot support C. The labor involved in chasing small fees is unsustainable. I vote for Option A to ensure the club remains manageable.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm torn, but I think Option A is the safest for the community. It keeps things simple and avoids the friction of tiers or per-event costs.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"I want to help the newcomers, so I'll vote for Option C! It's the most flexible for people who can't pay a big lump sum.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Kenji and Toshio. Let's keep it simple and welcoming. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Takumi,,I'll stick with my guns. Fairness over convenience. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"For the sake of the books and the sanity of the committee, I vote for Option A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll go with the majority for the sake of harmony. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
